From 724ef51a366dd301e7258eeac7bd177bed3de061 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Raul Tambre <raul@tambre.ee>
Date: Sat, 4 May 2019 15:48:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Fix incorrect use of 'is' operator for comparison in
 python/lib/gdb/command/prompt.py

The 'is' operator is not meant to be used for comparisons. It currently working
is an implementation detail of CPython.  CPython 3.8 has added a SyntaxWarning
for this.
---
